	(text "ADC / sensor = 47 / (33+47) = 0.5875 nominal; 0.5-4.5V becomes 0.294-2.644V.\n10nF filter: approximately 781Hz including series 1k. Use long ADC acquisition time and calibration.\nBAT54S clamps are current limited by 33k; verify fault-injection and leakage errors during testing.\nUse analog mode with NO internal pulls. Sensors must use board buck supply; no independently powered inputs.\nOpen input tends to 0V: firmware must reject readings outside the calibrated valid sensor range."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 251.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a8e664c7-c755-4b85-9db6-0416836ca509")
	)
